External MCMC validation fixtures

All CSV draw files here are MODIFIED EXCERPTS of the sources identified in
sources.json and manifest.json: three named variables/elements were selected
per dataset and serialized to 17 significant digits. All stored posterior
iterations and original within-chain order are retained. We did not thin,
resample, shuffle, or combine chains. Indices in sources.json are zero-based.
The generated CSV files carry this modification notice in their first line.

