scripts/validation/reference.R implements the classical ESS truncation
algorithm described by Stan v2.24.0, independently of the Rust implementation.
Stan copyright notices and BSD 3-Clause terms are retained in
licenses/stan-LICENSE.txt. Autocovariances are computed by R stats::acf.
Current comparisons use posterior::ess_basic and posterior::rhat_basic,
explicitly setting split = FALSE and TRUE, and posterior::mcse_mean.

expected.csv contains reference calculations for the five external draw sets.
semantics.csv contains separate SYNTHETIC boundary probes, not extra datasets.
